{"run_id": "20261120-1a625b5284e3", "tag": "kg-rag-agent", "status": "content_pending", "paper_count": 67, "as_of": "2026-11-20", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T12:43:41.024476+00:00", "mode": "90", "result_count": 67, "content_done": 10, "content_pending": 57, "guide_status": "not_required", "export_path": "docs/starter-pack/20261120-1a625b5284e3/papers.md", "selected_records": [{"id": "arxiv:2609.34145", "title": "Beyond Retrieval Relevance: Scene-Grounded Risk Entailment for Vision-Language Driving", "score": 9, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.34145v1", "published": "2026-09-28", "publication_date": "2026-09-28", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.34145v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "检索增强生成虽能为视觉语言驾驶系统提供外部安全知识，但检索到的风险规则可能相关却不适用于当前场景。本文构建驾驶风险知识图谱DRKG，并在VLM决策前引入SWRL推理阶段，由结构化感知实例化场景事实，联合满足前件时推导事件与有向风险关系。在nuReasoning上，NPS提升1.30分、NC提升2.76分，表明场景可适用的风险证据优于仅按语义相关性检索的知识。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2609.08217", "title": "Drive by Hindsight and Foresight: Tool-Grounded Synergistic Reasoning over Hierarchical Memory for Autonomous Driving", "score": 8, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.08217v1", "published": "2026-09-08", "publication_date": "2026-09-08", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.08217v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "视觉语言模型用于自动驾驶仍受幻觉、时空感知弱和泛化差困扰，现有CoT与检索增强方法缺乏主动感知与经验积累。本文提出分层驾驶记忆与主动工具调用耦合的闭环协同推理框架，并配套两阶段训练。7B模型在DriveLMM-o1上推理得分80.03、选择题准确率79.09%，超最强基线7.74分。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2609.32645", "title": "From Scene Graphs to Answers: Selective Neuro-Symbolic Reasoning for Autonomous Driving", "score": 8, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.32645v1", "published": "2026-09-26", "publication_date": "2026-09-26", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.32645v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "自动驾驶问答需对结构化场景信息做多种推理，现有视觉语言方法把异构推理统一交给单一神经网络。本文提出查询自适应神经符号框架，以分层时空场景图为基础，先由符号执行器精确求解，仅在无法求解时调用LLM做语义推理。在NuScenes-QA上总体准确率达80.63%，较纯LLM配置提升5.48个百分点，计数类问题提升最大。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2609.32157", "title": "CausalDriveBench: Evaluating Causal Reasoning in Vision-Language-Action Models for Autonomous Driving", "score": 8, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.32157v1", "published": "2026-09-26", "publication_date": "2026-09-26", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.32157v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "自动驾驶VLA模型虽能输出自然语言推理，但其是否反映场景因果结构尚缺检验。作者提出CausalDriveBench，基于Pearl因果层级构建因果场景图与结构化问答及反事实轨迹评测。10个驾驶VLA与3个通用VLM中最佳仅70.6%准确率，4个低于随机。因果问答与轨迹准确率不相关，说明流畅理由与准确轨迹均不等于因果理解。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2610.19549", "title": "GraphRAG-LTM: A Layered Threat Modeling Framework for Attacks on Graph Retrieval-Augmented Generation", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2610.19549v1", "published": "2026-10-14", "publication_date": "2026-10-14", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.19549v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "GraphRAG依赖文档知识图谱为LLM组装证据，其证据路径上的攻击尚未被充分研究。本文提出分层威胁建模框架GraphRAG-LTM，测试黑盒查询、白盒查询与图感知白盒三层嵌套攻击。实验显示仅用排序反馈即可降低答案质量，梯度访问强化查询攻击，删除桥接三元组进一步破坏多跳证据。该工作揭示了种子检索与图证据对失败结果的联合贡献。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2610.21464", "title": "Poisoning the Neighborhood: A Topology-Aware Topic-Level Attack on Large-Scale HNSW-based RAG Systems", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2610.21464v1", "published": "2026-10-15", "publication_date": "2026-10-15", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.21464v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2610.26528", "title": "A Semantic Knowledge Graph Construction Pipeline for Vehicle Intention Prediction in nuScenes", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2610.26528v1", "published": "2026-10-19", "publication_date": "2026-10-19", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.26528v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2610.03948", "title": "Retrieval-Augmented Large Language Model Decision-Making for Autonomous Driving Guided by Chinese Philosophical Wisdom", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2610.03948v3", "published": "2026-10-02", "publication_date": "2026-10-02", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.03948v3", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "自动驾驶决策需兼顾安全、效率与社会规范，但现有数值优化、序列预测和LLM方法对哲学伦理价值关注不足。作者提出CPW-Drive，以儒家思想为知识源构建价值原则与场景案例库，并用物理感知空间相似度检索实现闭环RAG决策。在Highway-env多车道任务上成功率显著超越最强基线，且碰撞-free步数最高、换道频率低。表明结构化价值引导可提升仿真闭环安全与稳定性，但存在效率与延迟权衡。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2609.31636", "title": "Grounding Vision-Language Models in Driving Semantics: A Multi-Dataset Predicate Framework for Explainable Reasoning", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.31636v1", "published": "2026-09-10", "publication_date": "2026-09-10", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.31636v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "视觉语言模型在驾驶场景理解中输出的语义关系难以核验。本文提出确定性多数据集谓词框架，从几何、运动学、时序、地图与交通控制证据推导场景语义，并在nuPlan与nuScenes上统一谓词定义、构建谓词知识图谱。人工标注验证宏F1达0.94与0.93，跨数据集平均差异仅0.02；在NuPlanQA九个子任务中七个取得最高准确率。该工作为可解释驾驶推理提供一致、可追溯的语义表示。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2609.37468", "title": "Backdoor in the Loop: Compromising Agentic Search via Malicious Retrievers", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.37468v1", "published": "2026-09-26", "publication_date": "2026-09-26", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.37468v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "智能体式RAG将推理与反复检索交织，检索器可影响证据与后续搜索决策。本文研究利用该反馈回路的检索器后门：攻击者仅提供被污染的检索器检查点，即可压制有用证据、持续召回指定文档或诱导长时间搜索。作者进一步提出“注入弱后门再遗忘”的净化假象来削弱检测器可见特征。结果暴露了弱防御反成隐蔽工具的系统性漏洞。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2610.34294", "title": "Factual Yet One-Sided: Stance Poisoning and Evidence Balancing in Retrieval-Augmented Generation", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2610.34294v1", "published": "2026-10-25", "publication_date": "2026-10-25", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.34294v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2611.11532", "title": "DriveFoundry: Co-Evolving Data and Model for Efficient Closed-Loop Iteration in Autonomous Driving", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2611.11532v1", "published": "2026-11-08", "publication_date": "2026-11-08", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.11532v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2609.38641", "title": "Vision-Language-Action Autonomous Driving Agent with Language-based Memory", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.38641v1", "published": "2026-09-29", "publication_date": "2026-09-29", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.38641v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "VLA驾驶模型受限于图像token成本，只能输入少量帧，难以处理全向停车到达顺序等依赖记忆的任务。AD-Memo将语言化记忆作为思维链扩展输出，记录关键周边物体并回灌为后续输入。配合两阶段训练（SFT与半闭环RL算法Da Capo）提升驾驶质量与场景问答，并产出可插拔记忆。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2609.15169", "title": "GRAVA: Grounded Reasoning-to-Action Representation and Learning for Autonomous Driving", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2609.15169v1", "published": "2026-09-14", "publication_date": "2026-09-14", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.15169v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "驾驶VLA模型虽先推理后行动，但中间推理与物理场景证据关联弱、与可执行行为脱节。GRAVA提出Grounded Reasoning-to-Action，将视觉区域、自车状态、轨迹锚定图与动作生成统一到单一自回归流中，并构建GR-NavSim数据与渐进训练策略。GRAVA-8B在NAVSIM上取得纯自回归驾驶模型最优，长尾场景关键物体合规率与闭环驾驶分数分别提升19.3%和20.5%。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2611.15225", "title": "Can MLLMs Reason over Surround-View Driving Videos? A Multi-View Autonomous Driving QA Benchmark", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2611.15225v2", "published": "2026-11-11", "publication_date": "2026-11-11", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.15225v2", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2610.34689", "title": "RSKD: Grounding Semantic Consistency in Driving VLMs via Distillation", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2610.34689v1", "published": "2026-10-26", "publication_date": "2026-10-26", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.34689v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2610.30953", "title": "Measuring the Reasoning-Action Coupling in Driving Vision-Language-Action Models through Counterfactuals", "score": 7, "route": "20260822-20261119/2610.30953v1", "published": "2026-10-22", "publication_date": "2026-10-22", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "h